  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Hub\n\t\tCapium Hub Overview\n\n### How to bulk download Docscan receipts\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 13 Jul, 2021 at  3:04 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nHub >> Select customer >> Purchases >> Docscan >> Filter dates to find the receipts >> Click on 'Export As' and select the format of the download\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to bulk download Docscan receipts\n\nHelp Guide:\n\nNavigate to the Hub module from the ecosystem, \n\nSelect the customer for which the receipts need to be downloaded.\n\nClick on purchases >> Docscan \n\nEnter a 'From' and 'To' date to filter the scanned receipts \n\nClick on the 'Export As' dropdown box to select the format you want to download the receipts \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117301\">Capium Hub</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000195363\">Capium Hub Overview</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to bulk download Docscan receipts\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 13 Jul, 2021 at  3:04 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Location:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Hub &gt;&gt; Select customer &gt;&gt; Purchases &gt;&gt; Docscan &gt;&gt; Filter dates to find the receipts &gt;&gt; Click on 'Export As' and select the format of the download</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><br><u dir=\"ltr\">Video Tutorial:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/d02c54c424984ce2b75f4f99a05fb537\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to bulk download Docscan receipts</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to the Hub module from the ecosystem, </p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134446304/original/tmYsZN0UquOQ2KJyJYG6HmZh2QMxzopF4A.png?1626183346\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134446304\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Select the customer for which the receipts need to be downloaded.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134447173/original/5x2pz4vr9vG458Lzn3VZpUV8Hb4Rl_ahIQ.gif?1626183757\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134447173\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Click on purchases &gt;&gt; Docscan </p><p dir=\"ltr\">Enter a 'From' and 'To' date to filter the scanned receipts </p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134447758/original/Voal8_egVvKy44qo9dubKL8BuQj5fNLZRA.png?1626184005\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134447758\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Click on the 'Export As' dropdown box to select the format you want to download the receipts </p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134448097/original/y_HhB_SZWPWabjXGc71vAuuxj3lAAUEJmw.png?1626184194\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134448097\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204406\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204406/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204406\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for